{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05794","headline":"嵩山十志十首 其十 · 卢鸿一","name":"嵩山十志十首 其十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水碧色兮石金光，灩熠熠兮濙湟湟。\n泉葩映兮烟茑临，红灼灼，翠阴阴。\n翠相鲜兮金碧潭，霜天洞兮烟景涵。\n有幽人兮好冥绝，炳其焕兮凝其洁，悠悠千古长不灭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢鸿一","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05794.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05794","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}